{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "f9587769ca7c5381105e2529737af108ee8390e9c4cf2c28d9588783ba22a012", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　開始前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8000_place", "source_sha256": "10395ba983253302491ddf8c3209e16c9d3a320ea2c8acb15bb9cd63bdbea6c1", "ja": "砂丘", "zh": "沙丘", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8001_p", "source_sha256": "c8374022d6aefefd3f893f6c52053e03492b96aac0869e4648b2748ec36f6a42", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』の\nグラビア撮影日。亜利沙のテーマは『舞姫』だ）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄日。亚利沙的主题是“舞姬”。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8002_028ari", "source_sha256": "ed4429ea061680f68814ede29210e35ca679e3a6d3612d2744edf53ee6932b1b", "ja": "うーん、不思議な力を持った舞姫ちゃんですか……。\nどう表現するか迷うトコですねぇ。", "zh": "嗯——拥有不可思议力量的舞姬吗……该怎么表现才好，还真让人纠结呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8003_p", "source_sha256": "cec7a65871c12be864c2e2050aceee6ab0b277350ae72ee89031f8a156c19b96", "ja": "そうだな。大変だと思うが、\n亜利沙の新しい魅力を引き出すチャンスだ！", "zh": "是啊。我知道这会很辛苦，但这也是发掘亚利沙全新魅力的机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8004_028ari", "source_sha256": "b4a698524bb5d25290ad4fb56f21be65df5ee2c0edd27f347d5968939098cad3", "ja": "新規開拓のチャンス……確かに！　ちなみに\nこの舞姫ちゃんの力って、どんなものなんでしょうか？", "zh": "开拓新领域的机会……确实如此！顺便问一下，这位舞姬的力量究竟是怎样的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8005", "source_sha256": "4b0de269cd410bec38b61d597bee14aa6a24b31dc7c1a0d48e56a67589cd54ca", "ja": "特にない", "zh": "没什么特别的", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8006", "source_sha256": "4aaf849935ee56883036e4066b2d5a43303a5b0e8e7d0d52fd721071817b53da", "ja": "雨を降らす", "zh": "让雨降下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8007", "source_sha256": "69eb41cf5f3d0074a16f302e0b75218e6fd623b34064b6fe70a8662b5884724e", "ja": "しゃっくりを止める", "zh": "止住打嗝", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8100_p", "source_sha256": "88e55c3c20d80cd4280df90a8a9fc2197215c928d2474b6c940860cbb3ab37f9", "ja": "特に資料には書いてなかったな。あえて言えば、\n美しい舞で、見た人全員を幸せにできるとか……。", "zh": "资料上倒是没特别写。硬要说的话，就是能用优美的舞姿，让所有看到的人都感到幸福……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8101_028ari", "source_sha256": "bcac1ad6808395471baa85ff7493cdb13e6833650f86600ba1f4617a399f4362", "ja": "なるほど。見た人を幸せに……。それって、アイドル\nちゃんに似てる……いえ、アイドルちゃんですよね！？", "zh": "原来如此。让看到的人幸福……这不是和偶像很像吗……不，偶像不就是这样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8102_028ari", "source_sha256": "96e1f58c34e598acd96e4e80865c5a4cb5c29b94f11b2bd0a947ed0c1c4d1a55", "ja": "ありさが身をもって、表現しましょう！　推しの輝きを\n……！　精一杯、撮影に臨ませて頂く所存です～っ！", "zh": "就让亚利沙亲身来展现吧！推し的光辉……！我会竭尽全力投入拍摄的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8200_p", "source_sha256": "4a0a935bf4b61bffe554c01f67212074e24fad9be4dcad688f96a1a5d1926c8c", "ja": "雨を降らすことができるそうだよ。\n水は生命の源だ。要は人の命を助ける力だな。", "zh": "听说还能让天降雨。水是生命之源。说到底，就是能够拯救人们生命的力量啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8201_028ari", "source_sha256": "a69514d8264530714e4c35377debec1d1b70133dda8d1483d0ebad9c6b76548d", "ja": "つまり、雨乞いもできちゃう舞姫ちゃんってコト\nなんですね！　なんだか主人公っぽいニオイがします。", "zh": "也就是说，舞姬小姐连求雨都能做到，对吧！\n总觉得有种主角的气质呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8202_028ari", "source_sha256": "52e24b0a4d8d9ba753e347419c29e9b6892ac61869de7ea648006e2e1bb29aa5", "ja": "日照りの村に現れては雨を降らせ、やがて次の村へ……\nなんて感じでしょうか？　かっこいいですー！", "zh": "出现在遭遇旱灾的村子里，让天空降下甘霖，然后再前往下一个村子……\n大概就是这种感觉吧？太帅了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8300_p", "source_sha256": "72a6c4d3c00aef46a8624011e1adc6a119e9c6f7455641ade14e52e45b060bae", "ja": "しゃっくりを止めることができるって話だ。まあ、\nしゃっくりは百回すると危ないと言われてるしな。", "zh": "听说它能让打嗝停下来。毕竟，\n据说打嗝打上一百次可是很危险的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8301_028ari", "source_sha256": "c75b5413b413ef056572f3f8b518c5b9b13f5e487358b3ba9518c5a5486edf8b", "ja": "百回で……というのは諸説ありますが、\n便利な力であることは違いありませんね～！", "zh": "说百次会……虽然有各种说法，不过这确实是很方便的力量呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_8302_028ari", "source_sha256": "cc5550b71b1b0c88daeab9c13f10d23603b6ef738c27a8df716a2137d86224c5", "ja": "わーっ！！　……こんな感じで、ありさが\nびっくりさせれば……あれ？　舞姫要素ゼロ！？", "zh": "哇啊！！……像这样，只要亚利沙\n吓一吓的话……咦？舞姬要素为零！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
